OL,5,Aallow couples to leave extra #1m
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour accuses the Conservatives of
OL,8,F"prioritising the wealthiest" instead
OL,9,Fof helping "ordinary families
OL,10,Fstruggling with the cost of social
OL,11,Fcare"
OL,13,FElsewhere in her speech, Badenoch
OL,14,Fpledges to cut the deficit and help
OL,15,Fyoung people into work - here's a recap
