OL,3,AFive arrested for inciting racial
OL,4,Ahatred outside Jewish group's
OL,5,Aheadquarters, says Met
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe arrests came as a number of student
OL,8,Fpro-Palestinian protests were also
OL,9,Ftaking place elsewhere in London three
OL,10,Fyears on from the 7 October attack on
OL,11,FIsrael by Hamas, in which around 1,200
OL,12,Fpeople were killed and 251 others were
OL,13,Ftaken as hostages by the militant
OL,14,Fgroup.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
